@startuml
title Approach A (SoE steers the process) — New Party: Create your own account

actor Customer
participant "EngagementManagement\nWeb UI" as WebUI
participant "EngagementManagement\nBFF" as BFF
participant "PartyInteractionMgt" as PIM
participant "PartyManagement" as PM
participant "PartyRoles\n&PermissionsMgt" as PRPM
participant "DigitalIdentityMgt" as DIM

Customer -> WebUI : 1 access web app
activate WebUI

WebUI -> BFF : 2 get available actions
activate BFF
BFF --> WebUI : 3 available actions: Identify yourself,\nCreate your Account, Browse B2C Catalogue, Read News

BFF -> PIM : 4 **TMF683 Party Interaction** POST partyInteraction\n(date, used channel)
activate PIM
PIM -> PIM : 5 check data & create interaction
PIM --> BFF : 6 **TMF683** 201 Created\n(interaction.id)
deactivate PIM
deactivate BFF

WebUI --> Customer : 7 present available actions
Customer -> WebUI : 8 Choose Create your Account
WebUI --> Customer : 9 present needed data
Customer -> WebUI : 10 enter account details\n(firstName, lastName, contactMedium, login, password)

WebUI -> BFF : 11 submit account details\n(firstName, lastName, contactMedium, login, password)
activate BFF

BFF -> BFF : 12 validate input data

BFF -> PIM : 13 **TMF683 Party Interaction** PATCH partyInteraction/id\n(new InteractionItem Create your Account)
activate PIM
PIM -> PIM : 14 check data & create interaction item
PIM --> BFF : 15 **TMF683** 200 OK\n(interaction.id, interactionItem.id)
deactivate PIM

BFF -> PM : 16 **TMF632 Party Management** POST /individual\n(firstName, lastName, contactMedium)
activate PM
PM -> PM : 17 check data & create individual with contact medium
PM --> BFF : 18 **TMF632** 201 Created\n(individual.id)
deactivate PM

BFF -> PRPM : 19 **TMF669 Party Role Management** POST /partyRole\n('portal user' (individual.id))
activate PRPM
PRPM -> PRPM : 20 check data & create party role with default permissions
PRPM --> BFF : 21 **TMF669** 201 Created\n(partyRole.id)
deactivate PRPM

BFF -> DIM : 22 **TMF720 Digital Identity** POST /digitalIdentity\n(login, password, individual.id)
activate DIM
DIM -> DIM : 23 check data & create identity
DIM --> BFF : 24 **TMF720** 201 Created\n(digitalIdentity.id)
deactivate DIM

BFF -> PIM : 25 **TMF683 Party interaction** PATCH /partyInteraction/id\n(interactionItem.id, individual.id, partyRole.id,\ndigitalIdentity.id, Create your Account done)
activate PIM
PIM -> PIM : 26 update interaction and interaction item
PIM --> BFF : 27 **TMF683** 200 OK\n(interaction.id, interactionItem.id)
deactivate PIM

BFF --> WebUI : 28 individual.id
deactivate BFF
deactivate WebUI

@enduml
